{"code": "1", "data": [{"advantages": [], "introductions": [{"code": "productIntroductionBva", "desc": "大件配送司机完成运单配送时，同步完成商品的安装操作。\n", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/icons-info/icon-prod-js.png", "name": "产品介绍"}, {"code": "chargeStandardBva", "desc": "分品类按件计费，安装费=品类件单价*服务数量，具体收费标准可致电京东物流官方客服950616或点击\"合作咨询\"。\n\n", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/icons-info/icon-fee.png", "name": "收费标准"}, {"code": "serviceScopeBva", "desc": "支持电视、洗衣机、电暖桌、跑步机、椭圆机、电动车、按摩椅、床垫、划船机、健身镜、动感单车品类。\n\n", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/icons-info/icon-fugai-fw.png", "name": "服务范围"}, {"code": "appScopeBva", "desc": "①使用京东大件配送服务可享送装一体，不可单独使用。\n②部分偏远地区暂不支持。家电、运动器材支持98.6%区县覆盖，家居软体全品类区县覆盖率97.7%，板式全品类区县覆盖率93.5%。", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/icons-info/icon-range.png", "name": "适用范围"}], "name": "送装一体", "productNo": "lq-a-0002", "sort": 3, "type": 2}, {"advantages": [], "introductions": [{"code": "productIntroductionBva", "desc": "提供大件超重货物送货入户/上楼服务。", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/icons-info/icon-prod-js.png", "name": "产品介绍"}, {"code": "chargeStandardBva", "desc": "货物重量*单价，具体收费标准可致电京东物流官方客服950616或点击“合作咨询”。", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/icons-info/icon-fee.png", "name": "收费标准"}, {"code": "appScopeBva", "desc": "超140kg的商品。", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3/product/icons-info/icon-range.png", "name": "适用范围"}, {"code": "instructionBva", "desc": "不支持需特殊入户场景，如吊装搬运。", "detailURL": "", "iconURL": "/vendor/jdl-oss.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/static/v3